[{"location":"","page":"Home","title":"Home","text":"CurrentModule = LXCat","category":"page"},{"location":"#LXCat","page":"Home","title":"LXCat","text":"","category":"section"},{"location":"","page":"Home","title":"Home","text":"Documentation for LXCat.","category":"page"},{"location":"","page":"Home","title":"Home","text":"","category":"page"},{"location":"","page":"Home","title":"Home","text":"Modules = [LXCat]","category":"page"},{"location":"#LXCat.product_label-Tuple{LXCat.AbstractCollision}","page":"Home","title":"LXCat.product_label","text":"product_label(c) -> Union{String,Nothing}\n\nProduct/excited-state label of a collision or cross section: the raw LXCat string for Excitation/Ionization/Attachment, nothing for process types without one or when the field is empty.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#LXCat.product_species","page":"Home","title":"LXCat.product_species","text":"target_species(c; labels=Dict()) -> PlasmaSpecies.Species\nproduct_species(c; labels=Dict()) -> Union{PlasmaSpecies.Species,Nothing}\n\nResolve target_label/product_label into PlasmaSpecies.Species (requires PlasmaSpecies to be loaded; provided by the LXCatPlasmaSpeciesExt extension). labels maps raw LXCat labels to LoKI notation first; anything unparseable falls back to a StringGas species.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"function"},{"location":"#LXCat.target_label-Tuple{LXCat.AbstractCollision}","page":"Home","title":"LXCat.target_label","text":"Target species label (the raw LXCat string) of a collision or cross section.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#LXCat.target_species","page":"Home","title":"LXCat.target_species","text":"target_species(c; labels=Dict()) -> PlasmaSpecies.Species\nproduct_species(c; labels=Dict()) -> Union{PlasmaSpecies.Species,Nothing}\n\nResolve target_label/product_label into PlasmaSpecies.Species (requires PlasmaSpecies to be loaded; provided by the LXCatPlasmaSpeciesExt extension). labels maps raw LXCat labels to LoKI notation first; anything unparseable falls back to a StringGas species.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"function"},{"location":"#LXCat.write_cross_section-Tuple{IO, CrossSection}","page":"Home","title":"LXCat.write_cross_section","text":"write_cross_section(io::IO, cs::CrossSection)\n\nWrite one CrossSection as a single LXCat-format record — the inverse of parse_string. See the module notes above _lxcat_keyword for what is and isn't preserved on a round trip.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"},{"location":"#LXCat.write_database-Tuple{AbstractString, Any}","page":"Home","title":"LXCat.write_database","text":"write_database(filename, cross_sections)\n\nWrite cross_sections (as returned by load_database) to filename in LXCat's text format, one write_cross_section record per entry.\n\n\n\n\n\n","category":"method"}]
